Upstream llvm/llvm-project commit 3dc4fd6dd41100f051a63642f449b16324389c96,
"[compiler-rt][sanitizer] Remove linux/scc.h (#194116)", 2026-04-25.
Linux removed include/uapi/linux/scc.h, so compiler-rt cannot build against
Ubuntu 26.10's kernel headers. clang-p2996 562409c7 predates the fix.
Only the diff is kept; build.sh applies it with git apply.

